Module141932Desc = View documents in Dolibarr: PDF, images, text, CSV, and viewers added by other modules
DocStudio = DocStudio
DocStudioDescription = View documents in Dolibarr through pluggable viewers
DocStudioDescriptionLong = DocStudio adds an « Open with DocStudio » link next to the files of the Documents tabs. The file opens in a viewer inside Dolibarr, with the same permissions as the download. PDF, images, text and CSV are shown without any other software. Other modules can add their own viewers.
