DocStudioWopiServer = Office server (optional)
DocStudioWopiServerHelp = Collabora Online, OnlyOffice or Euro-Office: Office and OpenDocument files open and are edited in the browser, by several users at the same time, and are saved in place in Dolibarr with the rights of each user. The office server must reach Dolibarr (address below) and the browser must reach it.
DocStudioWopiUrl = Address of the office server
DocStudioWopiUrlHelp = The one the browser opens, for example https://office.example.com. Empty: no office server.
DocStudioWopiHostUrl = Address of Dolibarr seen by the office server
DocStudioWopiHostUrlHelp = Only when the office server reaches Dolibarr by another address than the users. Empty: %s
DocStudioWopiOk = Office server reached (%s). Editing: %s. %s types opened for reading.
DocStudioWopiKo = Office server cannot be reached or gives no description: %s
DocStudioWopiBadUrl = Invalid address: it must start with http:// or https://.
DocStudioWopiAllowedIps = Addresses allowed to call Dolibarr
DocStudioWopiAllowedIpsHelp = IP addresses of the office server, separated by commas (IPv4, IPv6, IPv4 ranges a.b.c.d/n). Empty: any address, the token and the signature still protect. The address seen by Dolibarr is the one of the connection (not the one given by a proxy).
DocStudioWopiBadIp = Invalid IP address: %s
DocStudioWopiProofOn = Signature of the office server checked: every call must be signed by its key (WOPI proof keys).
DocStudioWopiProofOff = No proof key published by the office server: only the token protects the calls. Generate one on the server (Collabora: coolconfig generate-proof-key, or file /etc/coolwsd/proof_key).
DocStudioErrorValidatedMainDoc = This is the main document of a validated invoice: it cannot be replaced, save a copy.

