DocStudioDesktopTitle = Open with %s on this computer
DocStudioDesktopOpen = Open in %s
DocStudioDesktopHelpView = %s opens the file read only: changes made there are not saved in Dolibarr.
DocStudioDesktopHelpEdit = %s opens the file and saves it in place in Dolibarr. While it is open there, nobody else can change it.
DocStudioDesktopNothing = Nothing opens?
DocStudioDesktopExpire = Microsoft %s must be installed on this computer (Windows or macOS), and the browser first asks whether it may open it. The link works on this computer only, until %s. The address can also be pasted in File > Open.
DocStudioDesktopCopy = Copy the address
DocStudioDesktopCopied = Copied
DocStudioDesktopSetup = Office installed on the computers (« Open in Excel »)
DocStudioDesktopEnable = Offer « Open in Excel, Word, PowerPoint »
DocStudioDesktopEnableHelp = Microsoft Office installed on the computer of the user (Windows, macOS) opens the file by a signed address of %s, valid 10 hours and on that computer only, and saves it in place when the user may edit it. Office must reach this address, like the browser. Offered in « Open with », never by default.
DocStudioDesktopHttps = Dolibarr is not in HTTPS: Office may refuse to open or save the files, and their address goes in clear on the network.
DocStudioNoInstanceKey = The unique id of the instance ($dolibarr_main_instance_unique_id in conf.php) is missing or too short: the office server and the desktop Office stay off, because their tokens could not be signed safely. Add a random value of at least 16 characters in conf.php.

# Copy filed in a piece (attachment of a mail, inbox C2)
DocStudioSaveTo = Save a copy in %s
DocStudioErrorCompressBusy = A compression is already running for you: wait until it ends, then save again.
DocStudioGhostscriptProblemNotset = Ghostscript is not set.
DocStudioGhostscriptProblemName = The path must name the executable of Ghostscript (gs, or gswin64c / gswin32c on Windows), outside of the documents directory of Dolibarr.
DocStudioGhostscriptProblemMissing = This file does not exist or is not executable on the Dolibarr server.
DocStudioGhostscriptProblemRestricted = gs is not in $dolibarr_main_restrict_os_commands of conf.php: add it to this list to allow the compression.
DocStudioGhostscriptProblemNoexec = The exec function of PHP is disabled on this server.
DocStudioWopiRevokeTokens = Revoke the tokens in use
DocStudioWopiRevokeConfirm = Every document opened in the office server or in the desktop Office can no longer be read nor saved: users will have to open them again from Dolibarr. Continue?
DocStudioWopiTokensRevoked = Tokens revoked: the open documents must be opened again from Dolibarr.
DocStudioWopiTokensHelp = Each opening gives the office server a token valid %s h, for one user, one file and one mode. It is in the addresses the office server calls (logs of the web server): « Revoke the tokens in use » makes them all unusable.
